<https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/design.html#FR-13> a dcp:PortalRequirement ; rdfs:label "FR-13: Let organisations reuse the content through links, embedding, open data, AI assistants and an MCP server." ; dcp:realisedIn <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/reuse.html> , <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/data.html> ; dcp:provedBy dcp:check-C-28 , dcp:check-C-31 , dcp:check-C-32 .
<https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/design.html#FR-14> a dcp:PortalRequirement ; rdfs:label "FR-14: Help organisations connect and buy data management tools without lock-in, with open standards and RFI questions." ; dcp:realisedIn <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/tooling.html> ; dcp:provedBy dcp:check-C-33 .
<https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/design.html#FR-15> a dcp:PortalRequirement ; rdfs:label "FR-15: Signpost the sister portals where they help, naming each and its status, without merging their journeys or copying their content." ; dcp:realisedIn <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/quality.html> , <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/tooling.html> , <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/reuse.html> ; dcp:provedBy dcp:check-C-34 .
<https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/design.html#FR-16> a dcp:PortalRequirement ; rdfs:label "FR-16: Help people who work across the three portals choose where to start, in what order and why, without merging the portals." ; dcp:realisedIn <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/reuse.html> ; dcp:provedBy dcp:check-C-35 , dcp:check-B-17 .
<https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/design.html#FR-17> a dcp:PortalRequirement ; rdfs:label "FR-17: Let users take part in research privately, suggest and vote for ideas, and see the roadmap, backlog and how each item is prioritised against government strategy, in the open." ; dcp:realisedIn <https://cyberdudeuk.github.io/dam-capability-playbooks/research.html> ; dcp:provedBy dcp:check-C-36 , dcp:check-C-04 , dcp:check-B-01 .
